#: tta/cli/main.py:422
msgid ""
"Remove the thesis THESIS_ID from the project entirely.\n"
"\n"
"The stronger form of `exclude`, for a PDF that was added by mistake. Excluding keeps the thesis on record, so its identity is remembered and it is never silently analysed again; removing deletes the record as well, so the same PDF can afterwards be added again as a new thesis. Its cached analysis goes with it. This cannot be undone: nothing restores it, and there is no record left to re-include. The source PDF is never touched."
msgstr ""

